I'd like to know how lavaan calculates the optional FMI (fraction of missing information).  The cited reference by Savalei & Rhemtulla has both a scalar formula for single parameters and a matrix formula for multiple parameters.  I presume that lavaan is using the matrix version, but I just want to verify that.

